  <metadata>
    <name>VI-02 · Pacific Marine Circle</name>
    <desc>Reliable paved loop linking Victoria, Sooke, Port Renfrew, Lake Cowichan and Duncan; useful as the southern connector spine. Road geometry derived from OpenStreetMap contributors under ODbL; route selection is an independently authored research overview. Verify land access, closures, gates, weather and field signage.</desc>
